{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52862","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 韦斌","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抗情遗黼冕，高步出氛埃。\n横海鸿飞远，登仙鹤语催。\n希微余第宅，怳惚视婴孩。\n桃实三千岁，何当献寿来？\n（见孔延之《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}